[{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Checkpoints and Rollback (Part 3 of 3)","textKn":"Checkpoints ಮತ್ತು Rollback (ಭಾಗ 3 / 3)","level":"H1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Lesson Info","headingKn":"Lesson ಮಾಹಿತಿ","bodyEn":"• Type: Build · Language: Python (stdlib only) · Time: ~60 minutes. Part 3 of 3: split-brain execution with and without fencing at the target, a lease race between eight threads, a SAGA with durable step state, a compensation crash with a stable and a random key, failure injection against two provider types, history validation and a hash-chained audit. Every output below was genuinely produced by the lab file on Python 3.14.5. This is our own stdlib model of the ideas behind checkpoints and rollback (a legal-move state machine, durable checkpoints with a version check, leases and fencing tokens, an idempotency ledger, atomic preconditions, conditional rollback, crash injection at every boundary, a SAGA with durable compensation and a hash-chained audit log), not the real software, and one SQLite file plays both the workflow store and the target system in the engine lab, the provider is a table or dictionary, the clock is a number the lab chooses and nothing real is changed, so no real LLM behaviour is measured. The original code/main.py was not supplied, so the labs are our own implementation and the expected outputs were produced by running them. The lesson Part 3 said it had executed its own example, but that file and its output were not supplied, so no figure from it is reused here. The lesson mentions of eventual consistency, SAGA in production and the EU AI Act Article 14 are conceptual or cited and were not run. This lesson replaces the earlier lesson at this position.","bodyKn":"• Type: Build · ಭಾಷೆ: Python (stdlib ಮಾತ್ರ) · ಸಮಯ: ~60 ನಿಮಿಷ. ಮೂರು ಭಾಗಗಳಲ್ಲಿ 3ನೆಯದು: target ನಲ್ಲಿ fencing ಇದ್ದು ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲದ split-brain ಕಾರ್ಯಗತಗೊಳಿಕೆ, ಎಂಟು threads ನಡುವಿನ lease ಓಟ, ಸ್ಥಿರ ಹಂತ ಸ್ಥಿತಿ ಇರುವ SAGA, ಸ್ಥಿರ ಮತ್ತು ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ key ಇರುವ ಪರಿಹಾರ crash, ಎರಡು ಪೂರೈಕೆದಾರ ಪ್ರಕಾರಗಳ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ವೈಫಲ್ಯ ಚುಚ್ಚುವಿಕೆ, ಇತಿಹಾಸ ಮೌಲ್ಯೀಕರಣ ಮತ್ತು hash-ಸರಪಳಿ ಲೆಕ್ಕಪರಿಶೋಧನೆ. ಕೆಳಗಿನ ಎಲ್ಲಾ output ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೂಲಕ Python 3.14.5 ನಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಪಡೆದದ್ದು. ಇದು checkpoints ಮತ್ತು rollback (ಕಾನೂನುಬದ್ಧ-ಚಲನೆ ಸ್ಥಿತಿ ಯಂತ್ರ, ಆವೃತ್ತಿ ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆ ಇರುವ ಸ್ಥಿರ checkpoints, leases ಮತ್ತು fencing tokens, idempotency ಲೆಡ್ಜರ್, ಪರಮಾಣು ಪೂರ್ವಷರತ್ತುಗಳು, ಷರತ್ತಿನ rollback, ಪ್ರತಿ ಗಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ crash ಚುಚ್ಚುವಿಕೆ, ಸ್ಥಿರ ಪರಿಹಾರ ಇರುವ SAGA ಮತ್ತು hash-ಸರಪಳಿ ಲೆಕ್ಕಪರಿಶೋಧನೆ) ಹಿಂದಿನ ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳ ನಮ್ಮದೇ stdlib ಮಾದರಿ, ನಿಜವಾದ ಸಾಫ್ಟ್‌ವೇರ್ ಅಲ್ಲ, ಮತ್ತು engine ಲ್ಯಾಬ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದು SQLite ಫೈಲ್ workflow ಸಂಗ್ರಹ ಮತ್ತು ಗುರಿ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ ಎರಡನ್ನೂ ಪ್ರತಿನಿಧಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಪೂರೈಕೆದಾರ ಒಂದು ಟೇಬಲ್ ಅಥವಾ ನಿಘಂಟು, ಗಡಿಯಾರ ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಆಯ್ಕೆ ಮಾಡುವ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ ಮತ್ತು ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಏನೂ ಬದಲಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ನಿಜವಾದ LLM ವರ್ತನೆ ಅಳೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿಲ್ಲ. ಮೂಲ code/main.py ಒದಗಿಸಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಲ್ಯಾಬ್‌ಗಳು ನಮ್ಮದೇ ಅನುಷ್ಠಾನ ಮತ್ತು ನಿರೀಕ್ಷಿತ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಅನ್ನು ಅವನ್ನು ಓಡಿಸಿ ಪಡೆಯಲಾಗಿದೆ. lesson ನ ಭಾಗ 3 ತನ್ನದೇ ಉದಾಹರಣೆಯನ್ನು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದೇನೆ ಎಂದು ಹೇಳಿತು, ಆದರೆ ಆ ಫೈಲ್ ಮತ್ತು ಅದರ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಒದಗಿಸಿರಲಿಲ್ಲ, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಅದರ ಯಾವ ಅಂಕಿಯನ್ನೂ ಇಲ್ಲಿ ಮರುಬಳಸಿಲ್ಲ. eventual consistency, ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ SAGA ಮತ್ತು EU AI Act Article 14 ಬಗ್ಗೆ lesson ನ ಉಲ್ಲೇಖಗಳು ಪರಿಕಲ್ಪನಾತ್ಮಕ ಅಥವಾ ಉಲ್ಲೇಖಿತ ಮತ್ತು ಓಡಿಸಲಾಗಿಲ್ಲ. ಈ lesson ಈ ಸ್ಥಾನದ ಹಿಂದಿನ lesson ಅನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"The Slow Worker and the Undo That Is Retried","textKn":"ನಿಧಾನ Worker ಮತ್ತು ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸುವ Undo","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Fences, Sagas and Failure Injection","headingKn":"Fences, Sagas ಮತ್ತು ವೈಫಲ್ಯ ಚುಚ್ಚುವಿಕೆ","bodyEn":"Production adds two awkward cases to a crash: the old worker was only slow and is still running, and the undo itself can crash and be retried. This part runs a split-brain write against a target with and without fencing, races eight threads for one lease, builds a SAGA whose step statuses are database rows, crashes a compensation and retries it with a stable key and with a random one, injects a crash at every point of a forward path against two kinds of provider, validates a stored history and chains an audit log.","bodyKn":"ಉತ್ಪಾದನೆ crash ಗೆ ಎರಡು ಅನಾನುಕೂಲ ಪ್ರಕರಣ ಸೇರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ: ಹಳೆಯ worker ಕೇವಲ ನಿಧಾನವಾಗಿತ್ತು ಮತ್ತು ಇನ್ನೂ ಓಡುತ್ತಿದೆ, ಮತ್ತು undo ಸ್ವತಃ crash ಆಗಿ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಲ್ಪಡಬಹುದು. ಈ ಭಾಗ fencing ಇದ್ದು ಮತ್ತು ಇಲ್ಲದ target ವಿರುದ್ಧ split-brain ಬರಹ ಓಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಒಂದು lease ಗೆ ಎಂಟು threads ಓಟ ನಡೆಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಹಂತ ಸ್ಥಿತಿಗಳು ಡೇಟಾಬೇಸ್ ಸಾಲುಗಳಾಗಿರುವ SAGA ನಿರ್ಮಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಪರಿಹಾರವನ್ನು crash ಮಾಡಿ ಸ್ಥಿರ key ಮತ್ತು ಯಾದೃಚ್ಛಿಕ key ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ಮರುಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಎರಡು ರೀತಿಯ ಪೂರೈಕೆದಾರರ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ಮುಂದಿನ ಮಾರ್ಗದ ಪ್ರತಿ ಬಿಂದುವಿನಲ್ಲಿ crash ಚುಚ್ಚುತ್ತದೆ, ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿತ ಇತಿಹಾಸ ಮೌಲ್ಯೀಕರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ ಮತ್ತು ಲೆಕ್ಕಪರಿಶೋಧನೆ ಲಾಗ್ ಸರಪಳಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"diagram","data":{"headingEn":"Production Recovery","headingKn":"ಉತ್ಪಾದನಾ ಚೇತರಿಕೆ","svgCode":"<svg viewBox="0 0 300 190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="monospace" font-size="7"><rect width="300" height="190" rx="8" fill="#0f172a"/><text x="150" y="14" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">recovery needs ownership, fences and idempotent undo</text><rect x="10" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#022c22" stroke="#34d399"/><text x="50" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">fence</text><text x="50" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">enforced at target</text><rect x="110" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#422006" stroke="#fbbf24"/><text x="150" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">lease</text><text x="150" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">one winner</text><rect x="210" y="30" width="80" height="34" rx="5" fill="#1e1b4b" stroke="#a78bfa"/><text x="250" y="45" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">saga</text><text x="250" y="57" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">durable steps</text><rect x="80" y="110" width="140" height="34" rx="5" fill="#450a0a" stroke="#f87171"/><text x="150" y="125" fill="#e2e8f0" text-anchor="middle">compensation</text><text x="150" y="137" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">stable key</text><path d="M150,64 V110" stroke="#475569"/><text x="150" y="180" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6">recovery needs ownership, fences and idempotent undo</text></svg>","captionEn":"Split brain, SAGA compensation and audit are where recovery fails.","captionKn":"split brain, SAGA ಪರಿಹಾರ ಮತ್ತು ಲೆಕ್ಕಪರಿಶೋಧನೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಚೇತರಿಕೆ ವಿಫಲವಾಗುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"table","data":{"headingEn":"The seven experiments","headingKn":"ಏಳು ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು","headers":["Experiment","What the lab shows"],"rows":[["split brain","a late write from token 1 after token 2, with and without a fence"],["lease race","8 threads, one token"],["SAGA","shipping fails, payment then inventory are compensated"],["compensation crash","stable key against a random key"],["failure injection","6 crash points, 2 provider types"],["history validation","first illegal jump named"],["audit","a hash chain with fencing tokens and an anchor"]]}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Building and Testing the Ideas","textKn":"ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸಿ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಿಸುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"cr_3.py","headingEn":"Database, SAGA, audit and checks","headingKn":"ಡೇಟಾಬೇಸ್, SAGA, ಲೆಕ್ಕಪರಿಶೋಧನೆ ಮತ್ತು ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆಗಳು","descEn":"write_fenced updates only when the stored token is not newer, Saga keeps every step status as a row and compensates in reverse order, Audit chains hashes and first_illegal names the first impossible move.","descKn":"write_fenced ಸಂಗ್ರಹಿತ token ಹೊಸದಲ್ಲದಿದ್ದರೆ ಮಾತ್ರ ನವೀಕರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, Saga ಪ್ರತಿ ಹಂತ ಸ್ಥಿತಿಯನ್ನು ಸಾಲಾಗಿ ಇಟ್ಟು ಹಿಮ್ಮುಖ ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಪರಿಹರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, Audit hash ಸರಪಳಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತದೆ ಮತ್ತು first_illegal ಮೊದಲ ಅಸಾಧ್ಯ ಚಲನೆ ಹೆಸರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"class Db:
    def __init__(self, path):
        self.path = str(path)
        with self.conn() as db:
            db.executescript("""
            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS leases (workflow_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, worker_id TEXT, token INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0, expires_at REAL NOT NULL DEFAULT 0);
            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS target (resource TEXT PRIMARY KEY, value TEXT, highest_token INTEGER NOT NULL);
            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS effects (key TEXT PRIMARY KEY, kind TEXT NOT NULL);
            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS saga_steps (workflow_id TEXT NOT NULL, step_no INTEGER NOT NULL, name TEXT NOT NULL, fwd_key TEXT NOT NULL, comp_key TEXT NOT NULL,
              fwd_status TEXT NOT NULL, comp_status TEXT NOT NULL, PRIMARY KEY (workflow_id, step_no));
            """)

    @contextlib.contextmanager
    def conn(self):
        c = sqlite3.connect(self.path, timeout=10, isolation_level=None)
        try:
            yield c
        finally:
            c.close()

    def acquire(self, wid, worker, now, duration=30):
        with self.conn() as db:
            db.execute("BEGIN IMMEDIATE")
            row = db.execute("SELECT worker_id, token, expires_at FROM leases WHERE workflow_id=?", (wid,)).fetchone()
            if row is None:
                db.execute("INSERT INTO leases VALUES (?,?,1,?)", (wid, worker, now + duration))
                db.execute("COMMIT")
                return 1
            if row[0] is not None and row[2] > now:
                db.execute("ROLLBACK")
                return None
            token = row[1] + 1
            db.execute("UPDATE leases SET worker_id=?, token=?, expires_at=? WHERE workflow_id=?", (worker, token, now + duration, wid))
            db.execute("COMMIT")
            return token

    def renew(self, wid, worker, token, now, duration=30):
        with self.conn() as db:
            return db.execute("UPDATE leases SET expires_at=? WHERE workflow_id=? AND worker_id=? AND token=? AND expires_at>?", (now + duration, wid, worker, token, now)).rowcount == 1

    def release(self, wid, worker, token):
        with self.conn() as db:
            return db.execute("UPDATE leases SET worker_id=NULL, expires_at=0 WHERE workflow_id=? AND worker_id=? AND token=?", (wid, worker, token)).rowcount == 1

    def write_unfenced(self, resource, value):
        with self.conn() as db:
            db.execute("INSERT INTO target VALUES (?,?,0) ON CONFLICT(resource) DO UPDATE SET value=excluded.value", (resource, value))

    def write_fenced(self, resource, token, value):
        with self.conn() as db:
            db.execute("INSERT OR IGNORE INTO target VALUES (?, NULL, 0)", (resource,))
            return db.execute("UPDATE target SET value=?, highest_token=? WHERE resource=? AND highest_token<=?", (value, token, resource, token)).rowcount == 1

    def target_value(self, resource):
        with self.conn() as db:
            return db.execute("SELECT value FROM target WHERE resource=?", (resource,)).fetchone()[0]

    def effect(self, key, kind, idempotent=True):
        with self.conn() as db:
            if idempotent:
                db.execute("INSERT OR IGNORE INTO effects VALUES (?,?)", (key, kind))
            else:
                db.execute("INSERT INTO effects VALUES (?,?)", (key + "#" + uuid.uuid4().hex[:6], kind))

    def effect_count(self, kind):
        with self.conn() as db:
            return db.execute("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM effects WHERE kind=?", (kind,)).fetchone()[0]


class Saga:
    def __init__(self, db, wid, steps):
        self.db, self.wid, self.steps = db, wid, steps
        with db.conn() as c:
            for i, (name, _, _) in enumerate(steps):
                c.execute("INSERT OR IGNORE INTO saga_steps VALUES (?,?,?,?,?,'NOT_STARTED','NOT_STARTED')", (wid, i, name, f"{wid}-{name}", f"{wid}-{name}-undo"))

    def status(self):
        with self.db.conn() as c:
            return c.execute("SELECT name, fwd_status, comp_status FROM saga_steps WHERE workflow_id=? ORDER BY step_no", (self.wid,)).fetchall()

    def _set(self, i, col, val):
        with self.db.conn() as c:
            c.execute(f"UPDATE saga_steps SET {col}=? WHERE workflow_id=? AND step_no=?", (val, self.wid, i))

    def run(self, crash_in_compensation=None, random_comp_keys=False):
        log = []
        done = [i for i, s in enumerate(self.status()) if s[1] == "EXECUTED"]
        failed = False
        for i, (name, fwd, _) in enumerate(self.steps):
            if i in done:
                continue
            try:
                fwd(self.db, f"{self.wid}-{name}")
                self._set(i, "fwd_status", "EXECUTED")
                log.append(f"execute {name}")
            except Exception as e:
                self._set(i, "fwd_status", "FAILED")
                log.append(f"forward failure at {name}: {e}")
                failed = True
                break
        if failed:
            for i in reversed([i for i, s in enumerate(self.status()) if s[1] == "EXECUTED" and s[2] != "COMPENSATED"]):
                name, _, comp = self.steps[i]
                key = f"{self.wid}-{name}-undo"
                if random_comp_keys:
                    key += "-" + uuid.uuid4().hex[:6]
                comp(self.db, key)
                if crash_in_compensation == name:
                    raise SimulatedCrash(f"crash after compensating {name}, before recording it")
                self._set(i, "comp_status", "COMPENSATED")
                log.append(f"compensate {name}")
            return "COMPENSATED", log
        return "COMMITTED", log


def fwd_inventory(db, key):
    db.effect(key, "reserve")


def comp_inventory(db, key):
    db.effect(key, "release")


def fwd_payment(db, key):
    db.effect(key, "charge")


def comp_payment(db, key):
    db.effect(key, "refund")


def fwd_shipping(db, key):
    raise RuntimeError("Shipping provider unavailable")


def comp_none(db, key):
    pass


def make_steps():
    return [("inventory", fwd_inventory, comp_inventory), ("payment", fwd_payment, comp_payment), ("shipping", fwd_shipping, comp_none)]


def digest(v):
    return hashlib.sha256(json.dumps(v, sort_keys=True, separators=(",", ":")).encode()).hexdigest()


class Audit:
    def __init__(self):
        self.entries = []

    def append(self, actor, event, token):
        prev = self.entries[-1]["hash"] if self.entries else "GENESIS"
        e = {"seq": len(self.entries) + 1, "actor": actor, "event": event, "fencing_token": token, "prev": prev}
        e["hash"] = digest({k: v for k, v in e.items() if k != "hash"})
        self.entries.append(e)

    def verify(self, anchor=None):
        prev = "GENESIS"
        for i, e in enumerate(self.entries):
            if e["prev"] != prev or e["hash"] != digest({k: v for k, v in e.items() if k != "hash"}) or e["seq"] != i + 1:
                return False, i
            prev = e["hash"]
        if anchor is not None and prev != anchor:
            return False, "anchor mismatch"
        return True, None


LEGAL = {"PROPOSED": {"APPROVED"}, "APPROVED": {"IN_FLIGHT"}, "IN_FLIGHT": {"VERIFYING"}, "VERIFYING": {"COMMITTED", "ROLLBACK_PENDING", "ESCALATED"}, "ROLLBACK_PENDING": {"ROLLED_BACK", "ESCALATED"}}


def first_illegal(history):
    for a, b in zip(history, history[1:]):
        if b not in LEGAL.get(a, set()):
            return a, b
    return None


POINTS = ["before_in_flight", "after_in_flight", "after_effect", "after_record", "after_verifying", "after_commit"]


def mini_workflow(db, wid, idempotent, crash_at=None):
    """Forward path with durable progress kept in a dictionary that plays the checkpoint."""
    cp = db_state.setdefault(wid, {"state": "APPROVED", "recorded": False})

    def maybe(p):
        if crash_at == p:
            raise SimulatedCrash(p)
    maybe("before_in_flight")
    if cp["state"] == "APPROVED":
        cp["state"] = "IN_FLIGHT"
    maybe("after_in_flight")
    if cp["state"] == "IN_FLIGHT":
        db.effect(wid + "-charge", "mini", idempotent)
        maybe("after_effect")
        cp["recorded"] = True
        maybe("after_record")
        cp["state"] = "VERIFYING"
    maybe("after_verifying")
    if cp["state"] == "VERIFYING":
        cp["state"] = "COMMITTED"
    maybe("after_commit")
    return cp["state"]


db_state = {}"}},{"type":"code","data":{"filename":"cr_3.py","headingEn":"main(): experiments","headingKn":"main(): ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳು","descEn":"main() runs the seven experiments on temporary SQLite files.","descKn":"main() ತಾತ್ಕಾಲಿಕ SQLite ಫೈಲ್‌ಗಳ ಮೇಲೆ ಏಳು ಪ್ರಯೋಗಗಳನ್ನು ಓಡಿಸುತ್ತದೆ.","code":"def main():
    with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as d:
        section("1. Genuinely running: split-brain with and without fencing at the target")
        for fenced in (False, True):
